1
00:00:12,700 --> 00:00:13,800
(Let it go.)

2
00:00:43,724 --> 00:00:45,964
=Revenge From A Wife=

3
00:00:46,091 --> 00:00:48,317
=Episode 27=

4
00:00:48,479 --> 00:00:49,960
I killed her.

5
00:00:51,920 --> 00:00:52,679
Shut up!

6
00:00:53,039 --> 00:00:53,479
Guards!

7
00:00:54,079 --> 00:00:54,880
Take this wicked woman away!

8
00:00:55,200 --> 00:00:56,280
Have her beaten to death!

9
00:00:56,640 --> 00:00:57,159
Your Majesty!

10
00:00:57,359 --> 00:00:58,799
I'm your Yuying!

11
00:00:58,799 --> 00:00:59,359
Your Majesty!

12
00:00:59,479 --> 00:01:01,079
I'm your Yuying!

13
00:01:03,119 --> 00:01:03,920
Your Majesty.

14
00:01:04,600 --> 00:01:05,719
Zhang Heng deserved

15
00:01:06,119 --> 00:01:07,320
to die for his crimes.

16
00:01:08,039 --> 00:01:09,320
But Noble Consort Chen...

17
00:01:11,840 --> 00:01:12,799
I dare ask

18
00:01:13,239 --> 00:01:14,879
that Your Majesty spare her life.

19
00:01:15,200 --> 00:01:16,719
She killed Roujia.

20
00:01:17,359 --> 00:01:18,920
She deserves death too.

21
00:01:20,480 --> 00:01:21,760
Zhang Heng has been executed.

22
00:01:22,040 --> 00:01:23,400
If you execute her too,

23
00:01:23,719 --> 00:01:25,680
the realm will accuse Your Majesty

24
00:01:25,959 --> 00:01:27,280
of wiping them all out.

25
00:01:27,959 --> 00:01:29,239
If you spare her life

26
00:01:29,480 --> 00:01:30,719
and confine her to the Cold Palace,

27
00:01:31,000 --> 00:01:32,319
she can live to atone.

28
00:01:33,799 --> 00:01:35,079
Your Majesty's reputation for mercy

29
00:01:35,280 --> 00:01:36,400
will remain intact.

30
00:01:36,959 --> 00:01:38,519
I'm not pleading for her.

31
00:01:38,920 --> 00:01:40,040
I'm doing this for Your Majesty

32
00:01:40,120 --> 00:01:41,400
and for the late Empress.

33
00:01:50,560 --> 00:01:51,760
Then I'll do as you say.

34
00:01:57,840 --> 00:01:59,159
Consort Hui, Su Cao,

35
00:01:59,280 --> 00:02:00,799
is kind and virtuous.

36
00:02:01,319 --> 00:02:02,439
Effective immediately,

37
00:02:02,560 --> 00:02:03,920
she is promoted to Noble Consort

38
00:02:04,359 --> 00:02:05,719
and will oversee the inner palace.

39
00:02:07,920 --> 00:02:10,400
Concubine Yu has served the prince well.

40
00:02:10,480 --> 00:02:11,599
Promote her to Consort Yu.

41
00:02:13,519 --> 00:02:16,280
Strip Noble Consort Chen of her title.

42
00:02:16,759 --> 00:02:17,960
From this day forward,

43
00:02:18,520 --> 00:02:19,599
confine her to the Cold Palace.

44
00:02:20,039 --> 00:02:20,919
For the rest of her life,

45
00:02:21,400 --> 00:02:22,919
she may never leave the Cold Palace.

46
00:02:24,039 --> 00:02:25,120
Your Majesty!

47
00:02:27,039 --> 00:02:27,719
Your Majesty!

48
00:02:27,840 --> 00:02:28,520
Su Cao!

49
00:02:28,599 --> 00:02:30,039
Spare me your fake concern!

50
00:02:30,039 --> 00:02:30,879
I'm telling you,

51
00:02:30,879 --> 00:02:32,639
you'll fare no better than me!

52
00:02:54,240 --> 00:02:55,120
Let go of me!

53
00:02:57,159 --> 00:02:58,039
Where is this?

54
00:02:58,680 --> 00:02:59,360
You...!

55
00:02:59,560 --> 00:03:01,159
How dare you sneak me out of the palace?

56
00:03:01,280 --> 00:03:02,479
I now

57
00:03:02,759 --> 00:03:04,080
oversee all inner palace affairs.

58
00:03:04,919 --> 00:03:06,759
Dealing with a disgraced woman
in the Cold Palace

59
00:03:07,199 --> 00:03:08,479
is no great task.

60
00:03:09,439 --> 00:03:10,439
Besides,

61
00:03:10,680 --> 00:03:12,360
it's time you came to see them.

62
00:03:12,759 --> 00:03:13,560
Bah!

63
00:03:14,159 --> 00:03:16,759
These ghosts aren't worth kneeling to.

64
00:03:17,280 --> 00:03:18,120
Su Cao.

65
00:03:18,439 --> 00:03:20,199
Don't presume on a few days' favor.

66
00:03:20,439 --> 00:03:21,280
You think

67
00:03:21,439 --> 00:03:22,960
you can do whatever you want?

68
00:03:23,159 --> 00:03:23,919
I'm telling you,

69
00:03:23,919 --> 00:03:26,120
you're just the Empress's replacement.

70
00:03:26,400 --> 00:03:27,560
Once you grow old and your beauty fades,

71
00:03:27,840 --> 00:03:29,919
and you no longer look like her,

72
00:03:30,280 --> 00:03:32,919
you'll end up worse than I did.

73
00:03:33,000 --> 00:03:34,000
Finished?

74
00:03:36,680 --> 00:03:37,680
Do you know

75
00:03:37,840 --> 00:03:38,479
what sets

76
00:03:38,479 --> 00:03:39,120
you

77
00:03:39,319 --> 00:03:41,000
apart from me?

78
00:03:42,080 --> 00:03:44,120
Xiao Che's love means everything to you.

79
00:03:44,560 --> 00:03:45,599
To me,

80
00:03:46,759 --> 00:03:49,159
it was just a pawn in my game.

81
00:03:50,800 --> 00:03:52,520
This weaving pattern...

82
00:03:54,240 --> 00:03:55,080
(Your Highness.)

83
00:03:55,479 --> 00:03:58,479
(There's a grass called
Dragon's Beard Grass.)

84
00:03:58,719 --> 00:03:59,719
(It's remarkably tough.)

85
00:03:59,879 --> 00:04:00,719
(It won't snap.)

86
00:04:01,000 --> 00:04:01,879
(If you weave)

87
00:04:02,199 --> 00:04:04,120
(two shoots
from the same root together,)

88
00:04:04,639 --> 00:04:05,759
(the weave will hold.)

89
00:04:08,039 --> 00:04:08,719
You...

90
00:04:08,879 --> 00:04:10,639
So you really did know that craftsman.

91
00:04:13,400 --> 00:04:14,879
He was my husband,

92
00:04:15,360 --> 00:04:16,560
Chen Shouhe.

93
00:04:16,919 --> 00:04:18,479
Years ago, he came to the palace
to work.

94
00:04:18,599 --> 00:04:20,919
Just saying "same root" offended you,

95
00:04:21,120 --> 00:04:22,800
so you had him tortured to death.

96
00:04:23,800 --> 00:04:25,040
If I didn't avenge him,

97
00:04:25,480 --> 00:04:26,800
how could I go on living alone?

98
00:04:27,519 --> 00:04:28,360
So...

99
00:04:28,639 --> 00:04:30,680
So this was all your plan.

100
00:04:31,399 --> 00:04:32,439
I'll tell His Majesty.

101
00:04:32,439 --> 00:04:33,279
I'll tell him

102
00:04:33,399 --> 00:04:35,079
you deceived him from the very start.

103
00:04:39,079 --> 00:04:40,160
You think

104
00:04:40,800 --> 00:04:42,040
he'll still believe you?

105
00:04:42,199 --> 00:04:43,000
He will.

106
00:04:43,920 --> 00:04:45,199
He loves me.

107
00:04:45,439 --> 00:04:46,759
He promised me.

108
00:04:46,759 --> 00:04:47,959
He promised you

109
00:04:48,399 --> 00:04:50,399
he'd protect only you for life.

110
00:04:50,720 --> 00:04:51,680
Did he?

111
00:05:05,639 --> 00:05:06,439
(Yuying.)

112
00:05:07,279 --> 00:05:08,439
(This jade thumb ring)

113
00:05:08,439 --> 00:05:09,480
(is yours alone.)

114
00:05:10,079 --> 00:05:11,360
(For the rest of my life,)

115
00:05:11,879 --> 00:05:13,279
(I'll protect only you.)

116
00:05:14,120 --> 00:05:15,800
(No one will ever slight you again.)

117
00:05:20,639 --> 00:05:21,959
You're not the only one

118
00:05:22,360 --> 00:05:24,120
he's said those words to.

119
00:05:24,560 --> 00:05:25,600
Impossible.

120
00:05:26,720 --> 00:05:27,600
That's impossible.

121
00:05:28,240 --> 00:05:28,800
Right.

122
00:05:29,879 --> 00:05:31,480
You still think

123
00:05:31,839 --> 00:05:33,639
I framed Zhang Heng, don't you?

124
00:05:34,959 --> 00:05:35,879
You're wrong.

125
00:05:36,399 --> 00:05:37,319
It wasn't me.

126
00:05:40,720 --> 00:05:42,439
It was Xiao Che.

127
00:05:43,639 --> 00:05:45,399
Your uncle never tried
to assassinate him.

128
00:05:45,839 --> 00:05:47,560
Li Dehai tricked him

129
00:05:47,560 --> 00:05:49,160
into the hall armed and armored.

130
00:05:49,399 --> 00:05:50,560
Then he was accused in public

131
00:05:50,560 --> 00:05:52,120
of trying to assassinate the Emperor.

132
00:05:52,360 --> 00:05:55,319
Xiao Che had long feared Zhang Heng's
achievements eclipsing him.

133
00:05:55,720 --> 00:05:57,480
He'd long wanted to take back command.

134
00:05:57,959 --> 00:05:59,040
All I did

135
00:05:59,040 --> 00:06:00,879
was put the knife within his reach.

136
00:06:01,279 --> 00:06:02,759
The one who actually struck

137
00:06:03,360 --> 00:06:05,800
was the Emperor you loved all your life.

138
00:06:06,399 --> 00:06:07,199
No.

139
00:06:08,000 --> 00:06:09,000
That's not true.

140
00:06:09,000 --> 00:06:09,879
That's not true.

141
00:06:10,000 --> 00:06:11,040
That's not true.

142
00:06:11,279 --> 00:06:12,000
That's not true!

143
00:06:12,399 --> 00:06:13,279
Zhang Yuying.

144
00:06:13,680 --> 00:06:15,279
Don't you understand yet?

145
00:06:16,199 --> 00:06:17,759
Xiao Che never loved you.

146
00:06:18,199 --> 00:06:20,160
He only needed someone like Roujia

147
00:06:20,920 --> 00:06:22,480
to play out his grand show of devotion.

148
00:06:23,040 --> 00:06:24,160
When you were useful,

149
00:06:24,360 --> 00:06:25,920
he cherished you.

150
00:06:26,519 --> 00:06:27,600
When you weren't,

151
00:06:27,920 --> 00:06:29,439
he cast you aside.

152
00:06:29,720 --> 00:06:30,759
He did it to you.

153
00:06:30,920 --> 00:06:32,360
And to your uncle.

154
00:06:34,600 --> 00:06:35,279
No.

155
00:06:35,439 --> 00:06:36,680
That's not true.

156
00:06:43,839 --> 00:06:45,160
To look like Roujia,

157
00:06:45,360 --> 00:06:47,439
for years, you didn't wear
your beloved Shu brocade.

158
00:06:47,879 --> 00:06:48,920
But now,

159
00:06:49,240 --> 00:06:51,199
His Majesty will never visit you again.

160
00:06:51,439 --> 00:06:53,240
You have no reason to hold back now.

161
00:06:53,519 --> 00:06:56,199
You can finally wear your own clothes.

162
00:07:00,959 --> 00:07:01,759
Qing'er.

163
00:07:02,399 --> 00:07:04,759
Why is there only half a dress?

164
00:07:08,240 --> 00:07:10,560
Your Highness,
didn't you enjoy sawing off legs?

165
00:07:11,279 --> 00:07:13,040
You're that wet nurse's daughter.

166
00:07:14,519 --> 00:07:15,519
This Shu brocade...

167
00:07:15,920 --> 00:07:17,560
I altered it for you.

168
00:07:18,000 --> 00:07:19,759
You like wearing other people's skin.

169
00:07:20,040 --> 00:07:21,920
Now you're only half a person yourself.

170
00:07:22,680 --> 00:07:23,920
Wear it on your final journey.

171
00:07:24,360 --> 00:07:25,240
In the afterlife,

172
00:07:25,920 --> 00:07:27,399
my mother will be waiting for you.

173
00:07:27,920 --> 00:07:28,360
No.

174
00:07:28,480 --> 00:07:29,040
No!

175
00:07:29,240 --> 00:07:29,959
Don't!

176
00:07:30,399 --> 00:07:31,000
Don't!

177
00:07:31,199 --> 00:07:33,959
Don't!

178
00:07:39,519 --> 00:07:41,399
If His Majesty can't forget you,

179
00:07:41,439 --> 00:07:43,360
he'll find another consort

180
00:07:43,879 --> 00:07:46,879
to wear your human-skin Shu brocade
that fits her just right.

181
00:07:49,319 --> 00:07:50,279
No!

182
00:07:50,439 --> 00:07:51,199
Let's go.

183
00:08:02,000 --> 00:08:03,040
(Shouhe.)

184
00:08:03,879 --> 00:08:05,399
(I finally did it.)

185
00:08:22,560 --> 00:08:26,747
♪Sunset fades beyond the lonely city♪

186
00:08:26,881 --> 00:08:30,494
♪Dusk snow paints the green hills♪

187
00:08:30,729 --> 00:08:33,328
♪A lone rider storms the old pass♪

188
00:08:33,365 --> 00:08:35,645
♪Drunk, I gaze by lamplight♪

189
00:08:35,692 --> 00:08:39,521
♪Old friends have all drifted away♪

190
00:08:39,923 --> 00:08:43,276
♪My broken sword rusts, as do I♪

191
00:08:44,203 --> 00:08:47,716
♪Jackdaws cry into the night♪

192
00:08:48,216 --> 00:08:50,783
♪Half a banner snaps in the wind♪

193
00:08:50,909 --> 00:08:52,942
♪In dreams, I return to the camps♪

194
00:08:53,009 --> 00:08:56,786
♪Moonlight chills my armor♪

195
00:08:57,136 --> 00:09:01,469
♪Life is a dream through many winters♪

196
00:09:01,692 --> 00:09:05,199
♪I gaze beyond the edge of the world♪

197
00:09:05,380 --> 00:09:08,233
♪Parting sorrow spills across the moon♪

198
00:09:08,300 --> 00:09:13,914
♪The moon and wind mean nothing now♪

199
00:09:13,954 --> 00:09:16,968
♪History turns to ash before ink dries♪

200
00:09:17,009 --> 00:09:23,017
♪Who plays the zither
and sighs at the pavilion?♪

201
00:09:23,684 --> 00:09:30,639
♪The past has faded away♪

202
00:09:30,639 --> 00:09:34,671
♪The past has faded away♪
